</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Char\">Char</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"reason-phrase character class:\nHTAB / SP / VCHAR / obs-text\n\nReference: https://httpwg.org/specs/rfc9110.html#reason.phrase","docLink":"./Std/Http/Internal/Char.html#Std.Http.Internal.Char.reasonPhraseChar","kind":"def","line":201,"name":"Std.Http.Internal.Char.reasonPhraseChar","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Internal/Char.lean#L201-L209"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Internal/Char.html#Std.Http.Internal.Char.obsText\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">Char</span>.<span class=\"name\">obsText</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Char\">Char</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"obs-text = %x80-FF (and higher Unicode scalar values in this library's `Char` model).","docLink":"./Std/Http/Internal/Char.html#Std.Http.Internal.Char.obsText","kind":"def","line":194,"name":"Std.Http.Internal.Char.obsText","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Internal/Char.lean#L194-L199"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Internal/Char.html#Std.Http.Internal.Char.rws\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">Char</span>.<span class=\"name\">rws</sp